="text-lg mt-0.5 shrink-0">📌</span><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Levy notices issued</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Harbour View</p></div><span class="text-xs text-ink-muted whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">1 Oct 2026</span></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`NSW owner finance (golden) > the payment upload page 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-2" href="/owner/finance"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8L10 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Finance</a><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink mb-1">Upload Payment Confirmation</h1><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Upload proof of payment for your levy contributions. Your strata manager will review and confirm the payment.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Payment Details</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Upload a bank receipt, transfer confirmation or screenshot as proof of payment.</p></div></div><form class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-4"><div class=""><label for="levyNoticeId" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Levy Notice (optional)</label><select id="levyNoticeId" name="levyNoticeId" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"><option value="">Select a levy notice...</option><option value="n1">Harbour View - LN-1 · Administrative Fund levy, Jul–Sep 2026 · $305.00 outstanding</option></select></div><div><label for="file" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Payment Proof<span class="text-red-500 ml-0.5">*</span></label><input id="file" type="file" required="" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.heic" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink file:mr-4 file:py-1 file:px-3 file:rounded-md file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-medium file:bg-mint-soft file:text-turquoise hover:file:bg-mint focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors" name="file"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Max 10 MB. PDF, PNG, JPG, JPEG, HEIC accepted.</p></div><div class=""><label for="documentDate" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Payment Date</label><input id="documentDate" type="date" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="documentDate"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The date the payment was made.</p></div><div class=""><label for="amount" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Amount Paid</label><input id="amount" type="number" placeholder="0.00" step="0.01" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="amount"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The amount transferred.</p></div><div class=""><label for="payerName" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Your Name</label><input id="payerName" type="text" placeholder="e.g. John Smith" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="payerName"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Name shown on the bank transfer.</p></div><div class=""><label for="payeeReference" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Reference / Description</label><input id="payeeReference" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Levy Q1 2026 Lot 5" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="payeeReference"/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Bank reference used for the transfer.</p></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " type="submit">Upload Payment Confirmation</button><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " href="/owner/finance">Cancel</a></div></form></div></div>"`;

exports[`NSW owner finance (golden) > the platform fees page header 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-8"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-2" href="/owner/finance"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8L10 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Finance</a><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink mb-1">StrataVerze Fees</h1><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">What StrataVerze charges your owners corporation, and why.</p></div></div><section class="space-y-4"><div>fees</div></section></div>"`;

exports[`NSW owner finance (golden) > the treasurer's page 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-2" href="/owner/finance"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8L10 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Finance</a><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink mb-1">Treasurer</h1><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">This month at a glance: what is unmatched, waiting, overdue or held in suspense.</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-ink">October 2026</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">1 area needs attention.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Unmatched</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">0</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Awaiting approval</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">0</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Overdue levies</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">$305.00</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">In suspense</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">$0.00</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-5"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mb-3"></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-medium uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">This period</p><p class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink">Not set up</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Unmatched bank transactions</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Every imported transaction is matched.</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><a class="text-sm text-turquoise underline" href="/owner/finance/reconciliation">Reconciliation</a></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Nothing to match.</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Waiting for approval</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">No invoices or refunds are waiting.</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><a class="text-sm text-turquoise underline" href="/owner/finance/approvals">Payment approvals</a></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Nothing waiting.</p></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Overdue levies</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">1 notice across 1 lot, longest overdue first.</p></div></div><ul class="divide-y divide-line"><li class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-2 text-sm"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-ink break-words">Lot 1, notice LN-1</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Due 1 Aug 2026, 87 days overdue</p></div><span class="shrink-0 tabular-nums text-ink">$305.00</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Held in suspense</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Nothing is held in suspense.</p></div><div class="shrink-0"><a class="text-sm text-turquoise underline" href="/owner/finance/reconciliation">Reconciliation</a></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Nothing in suspense.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Financial periods</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">No financial period covers today. The strata manager sets up periods.</p></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Every period that has ended is closed.</p></div></div>"`;

